#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions are limited to those of the form `X*stretch + Y` where `X` and `Y` are floating point or integer constants.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Stretch expression จำกัดให้อยู่ในรูปแบบ `X*stretch + Y` โดยที่ `X` และ `Y` เป็นค่าคงที่แบบ floating point หรือจำนวนเต็ม\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"ไม่ถูกต้อง\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"ถูกต้อง\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions can only include a single stretch variable.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"        <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Stretch expression สามารถมี stretch variable ได้เพียงตัวเดียว\n"
